{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107743","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107743/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107743/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107743/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107743","id":3161662821,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc68cyVl","number":107743,"title":"CPUParticles2D Node deletes itself in inspector if One Shot is turned on, then Emitting is turned on, with queue_free() connected to finished()","user":{"login":"PIZZA-ALERT","id":101937409,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhNxAQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101937409?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PIZZA-ALERT","html_url":"https://github.com/PIZZA-ALERT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PIZZA-ALERT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PIZZA-ALERT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PIZZA-ALERT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PIZZA-ALERT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PIZZA-ALERT/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PIZZA-ALERT/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PIZZA-ALERT/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PIZZA-ALERT/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PIZZA-ALERT/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-06-20T01:29:13Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T08:30:27Z","closed_at":"2025-06-20T08:30:24Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.4.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11, 24H2\n\n### Issue description\n\nTitle.\n\nI have a Node2D scene with a single CPUParticles2D scene. The particles are set to 1.0 explosiveness to give a burst effect. I connected the finished() signal to queue_free() so that the effect deletes itself from CPU processing after emitting. I turned on One Shot in the inspector so that it only fires once, and wanted to preview the effect, so I clicked the Emitting box as well. This deleted the CPUParticles2D node from the editor. After this, it's just gone. No particles to show in-game or anything.\n\nI would expect the node to get deleted on a per-instance basis while in-game, but not in-editor. Having nodes delete themselves in-editor can't be helpful to anyone, can it? Maybe this is intentional, but it seems very odd.\n\nThankfully I was able to close the editor and reload it to get my work back, as undo doesn't bring it back.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open project.\n- Go to hit_effect scene.\n- Turn on Emitting.\n- See that the CPUParticles2D node is gone.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[Space Shooter.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20827649/Space.Shooter.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107743/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107743/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}